  headliner: <b>Pop-Store Slashes "El Doo Doo" Prices In Half As Viral Plush Craze
    Abruptly Collapses</b>
  bodyText: "In a stunning reversal from the scalper brawls and overnight campouts
    seen just days ago, New Manila\u2019s flagship Pop-Store announced emergency
    markdowns of up to 60 percent on its once-coveted \"El Doo Doo\" plush monsters
    today after consumer demand fell off a cliff. "
